  m_Name: Titan's Mask
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Maskbound.Core.MaskData
  maskName: Titan's Mask
  maskType: 1
  maskIcon: {fileID: 0}
  description: 'Aspect of endurance and absolute force.


    This mask bears the
    will of Titan, the unmovable giant of earth.

    While worn, the bearer becomes
    a walking fortress slow, heavy, and unstoppable.

    The ground responds to
    your presence, and enemies break before you do.


    Titan does not advance.
    He endures.'
